    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B137_R0089",
      "file_path": "/data/SC1.DK4",
      "block": 137,
      "speaker": "Gerhard Adernkatz",
      "context": "Camille apologizes for Lil's behavior. Charles resents her earlier remarks, but Hodram recognizes Camille's ability and promises that they will be safe. Gerhard and Hodram turn to their own crew needs once Camille leaves.",
      "clean_Japanese": "地中海は海洋貿易立国の多い地域です\nリスボンやセビリアなどの大きな都市で\n捜せば、有能な者にめぐり会えるかも\nしれません",
